{"id":"af673075b2efc860","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-theory-extension.md","title":"Theory Extension","display":"df-theory-extension — Theory Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-theory-extension","aliases":["92-df-theory-extension"],"display":"df-theory-extension — Theory Extension","depends_on":["[[92-df-theory]]","[[92-df-theory-closure]]","[[92-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-theory-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-theory-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory-extension — Theory Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"668e712bdadc015a\" href=\"?note=668e712bdadc015a\" title=\"92-df-theory-closure\">92-df-theory-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\)</span> (closed theory parameter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\)</span> (consequence-closure operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"668e712bdadc015a\" href=\"?note=668e712bdadc015a\" title=\"92-df-theory-closure\">92-df-theory-closure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}extension} \\vdash T+_G\\varphi\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cn}_G(T\\cup\\{\\varphi\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}extension} \\vdash T+_G\\varphi\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cn}_G(T\\cup\\{\\varphi\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理论扩展：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T + \\varphi\">\\(T + \\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>添加新公理<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}(T \\cup \\{\\varphi\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}(T \\cup \\{\\varphi\\})\\)</span></li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>是已固定的内部一致性句，则例子为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+_G\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(T+_G\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span>及<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+_G\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(T+_G\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span>；外部元语言谓词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\)</span>不能直接放进句子集合</li>\n<li>扩展可能不一致</li>\n<li>扩展增大定理集</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"reso